  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishmeent of Environmental school clubs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Department of Environment (DOE) of the Ministry of Land, Water and Environment, being the major institution responsible for coordinating environmental actions in Eritrea is struggling to secure a  better environment and health citizens, through active participation. Yet the biggest challenge is low  environmental   awareness   levels   of   the   citizens.   Environmental   awareness   raising   programmes   for capitalizing knowledge and bringing behavioral changes towards knowledge management systems is a top component of sustainable environmental solutions.   Educating, training and organizing the young generation in a manner of environmentally friendly practices is a priority that our future sustainable  environmental protection relies</narrative>
  </description>
